WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.210
A café.

2
00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.540
A skate park.

3
00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:03.900
A living room.

4
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:06.780
In each one, a church is meeting.

5
00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:11.920
Many churches face falling numbers,
fewer clergy and closing buildings.

6
00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:18.010
Yet in 2004, a Church of England report
said Britain is now a mission field.

7
00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:22.630
If fewer Britons go to church, why are
new churches springing up in cafés,

8
00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.560
homes and woods?

9
00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:27.540
In this mission, you'll
meet new kinds of church,

10
00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:30.490
and ask what makes
something a church at all.

11
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.190
Then you'll weigh up whether
they are signs of life,

12
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.100
or signs of decline.

13
00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:40.440
Your mission: find out why new kinds of
church are appearing while old ones empty.
